#: ../../../reference/interfaces/system-source-code-interface.md:2
msgid "system-source-code interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/system-source-code-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"`system-source-code`  allows read-only access to  `/usr/src`  on the host "
"system, a directory that typically contains either the headers or the full "
"source code and configuration of the host's Linux kernel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/system-source-code-interface.md:6
msgid ""
"The interface it is not connected automatically because  the interface "
"reveals kernel configuration and patches for the running system, which may "
"or may not correspond to those found in public distro packages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/system-source-code-interface.md:8
msgid "**Auto-connect** : no"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/system-source-code-interface.md:10
msgid "Requires snapd version  *2.46+* ."
msgstr ""
